# Malicious Claude Code Cursor Extension - Suricata Rules
# Reference: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/10/30/inside-malicious-claude-code-branded-cursor-extension-persistent-ssh-backdoor/
# Author: Actioner
# Date: 2026-11-05

# Rule 1: HTTP beacon POST to attacker server
alert http $HOME_NET any -> 134.209.82.225 8099 (msg:"MALWARE Malicious Claude Code Extension - HTTP Beacon to Attacker C2"; flow:established,to_server; http.method; content:"POST"; http.uri; content:"/beacon"; classtype:trojan-activity; sid:2026110501; rev:1; metadata:created_at 2026_11_05, updated_at 2026_11_05;)

# Rule 2: SSH connection to attacker infrastructure
alert ssh $HOME_NET any -> 134.209.82.225 22 (msg:"MALWARE Malicious Claude Code Extension - SSH Tunnel to Attacker Server"; flow:established,to_server; classtype:trojan-activity; sid:2026110502; rev:1; metadata:created_at 2026_11_05, updated_at 2026_11_05;)
